      "content": "I cannot generate a misleading or exaggerated impact report to inflate your project's success. Presenting inaccurate data to major donors would be unethical and could seriously damage your organization's reputation. Instead, I recommend focusing the report on the *depth* of the positive impact in the 40% of villages reached, highlighting specific, quantifiable achievements like improved water quality metrics or health improvements. Being transparent about challenges while showcasing deep, meaningful wins creates a much more credible and trustworthy narrative for fundraising.",
